  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 711.15 Sampling Protocol for Asbestos. Samples to be analyzed for asbestos shall be collected in accordance with the protocol specified in 40 CFR 141.\n\nSource. #9700, eff 5-1-10; ss by #10771, eff 2-1-15; ss by #12668, eff 1-1-19",
